-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----
PLACEHOLDER — replace with your local MQTT broker's private-CA PUBLIC
certificate (PEM). This is the trust anchor the app uses to verify the
local Mosquitto broker over mTLS (see MqttTls.kt / spec 11). It is the
*public* CA cert (safe to ship); the client identity is the separate,
never-committed .p12 imported on-device. The real cert is gitignored.
-----END CERTIFICATE-----
